    "chunk_text": "arn w\u00e6s gesund, & God silf him behet, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh his cyn sceolde eall Abraham, \u00fee wolde Isaac geoffrian be Godes h\u00e6se, h\u00e6fde getacnunge \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican F\u00e6der, \u00fee his Seo \u00feridde yld w\u00e6s \u00f0a wuniende o\u00f0 Dauid, \u00feone m\u00e6ran cyning Abrahames cynnes; of \u00f0am com Crist Of Cham, Noes suna, com \u00fe\u00e6t Chananeisce folc, & of Iaphet, \u00feam ginstan, \u00fee w\u00e6s gebletsod \u00feurh & se \u00e6lmihtiga God \u00e6fter Noes flode eallum mancinne forgeaf him gem\u00e6nlice fisccinn & fugolcinn Isaac \u00fea gestrynde Esau & Iacob, twegen getwisan on micelre getacnunge. Ac se gingra bro\u00f0or, \u00fee Iacob w\u00e6s gehaten, w\u00e6s Gode leofre for his godum \u00feeawum, & for his Se gestrynde twelf suna; \u00fea syndon heahf\u00e6deras, namcu\u00f0e weras. & wear\u00f0 \u00fea micel hunger seofon gear on an, & hig si\u00feodon ealle to Egipta lande, \u00fe\u00e6r hi bigleofan His ginsta sunu buton anum, w\u00e6s Ioseph gehaten, wear\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6r hlaford on Egipta lande under \u00feam Seo o\u00feer boc ys Exodus gehaten, \u00fee Moyses awrat be \u00feam miclum tacnum & be \u00feam tyn witum, \u00fee Se wear\u00f0 acenned, swa swa us ky\u00f0 \u00feeos boc, & his bro\u00f0er Aaron, Amrames sunu, on Pharaones d\u00e6ge, \u00d0a wolde God habban \u00fe\u00e6t folc of \u00f0am lande Abrahames cynnes eft to heora earde. Ac se Pharao nolde \u00fe\u00e6t folc fram him l\u00e6tan, \u00e6r \u00fe",
